   "cooked": "<p>Like we promised, the Rewards Group is doing some retroactive TEC rewards payouts for users who received praise before they activated their account in the new system, and therefore missed their original distributions. We will do these distributions regularly.<br/>\nThe first payout consists of people who activated until the <strong>15th of September 2022</strong>. Those users are:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>User</th>\n<th>TEC amount</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>AnaTech#7412</td>\n<td>200.147910487139</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JessicaZartler#2263</td>\n<td>141.72198660458616</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>johnjonas#2307</td>\n<td>95.05885122484499</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MorganicMovement <img alt=\":mushroom:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/mushroom.png?v=10\" title=\":mushroom:\"/>#1085</td>\n<td>63.74472129429074</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>stef#9877</td>\n<td>57.4037780782508</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>streamerd#5565</td>\n<td>56.908643062085254</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>taxil#8577</td>\n<td>52.7292354911727</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Alp#3768</td>\n<td>50.091801474105075</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>withinthevacuum#2626</td>\n<td>35.70023446847456</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mark D#6686</td>\n<td>29.27850856911136</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>miguelb#5176</td>\n<td>19.84688469219233</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pab​:honeybee:<img alt=\":octopus:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/octopus.png?v=10\" title=\":octopus:\"/>#6151</td>\n<td>19.02051354319915</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WhyldWanderer#7002</td>\n<td>18.19587460600988</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Aemikorobinson#5961</td>\n<td>10.606181748530135</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>russlive215 (<img alt=\":mage:t5:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/mage/5.png?v=10\" title=\":mage:t5:\"/>, <img alt=\":mage:t5:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/mage/5.png?v=10\" title=\":mage